usage: placement.py [-h] --bin BIN --out OUT --image IMAGE
                    [--trigger {demand,controlled}]

Real provisioner/hooks + two agents, on one shared Linux VM. Demand mode uses
real node write-pressure requests; controlled mode diagnoses coalescing
without creating donor demand.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --bin BIN
  --out OUT
  --image IMAGE
  --trigger {demand,controlled}
